body:
omg thank you so much, that fixed it. i have been "working with" chatgpt trying to get this fixed for days.

solution:
launch godot with --path or from the project folder with --editor

for others interested, below is my gdscript.lua in my nvim plugins folder. if anyone has improvements to this i would love to make it nicer, but this is functioning
```
return {
  {
    "neovim/nvim-lspconfig",
    config = function()
      print("GDScript LSP configuration loaded")
      local lspconfig = require("lspconfig")

      lspconfig.gdscript.setup({
        filetypes = { "gdscript" },
        root_dir = function(fname)
          local util = require("lspconfig.util")
          return util.root_pattern("project.godot", ".git")(fname) or vim.fn.getcwd()
        end,
        single_file_support = false,
      })
    end,
  },
  {
    "nvim-treesitter/nvim-treesitter",
    lazy = false,
    priority = 1000,
    config = function()
      vim.filetype.add({ extension = { gd = "gdscript" } })
    end,
  },
}
```
